1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 31=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,950
If it weren't for Lin Jinqi,

7
00:01:43,032 --> 00:01:44,990
how would Fourth Master
ever have been convicted?

8
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:45,840
Fourth Madam Dai.

9
00:01:46,056 --> 00:01:48,280
Dai Rong took his own life
out of fear of punishment

10
00:01:48,290 --> 00:01:49,450
for colluding with Wo pirates.

11
00:01:49,460 --> 00:01:50,870
What does it have to do with others?

12
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:51,430
You...

13
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:52,950
That's enough.

14
00:01:52,968 --> 00:01:53,870
Let's leave here.

15
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:06,680
No wonder you went
from a sparrow to a phoenix

16
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,590
and became Madam Lin.

17
00:02:08,648 --> 00:02:10,600
You certainly know
how to get what you want.

18
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,400
Madam Dai.

19
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,750
You specifically invited me here.

20
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:31,280
Surely it wasn't to discuss

21
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,430
sparrows and phoenixes.

22
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:35,750
What you really want to know

23
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:38,710
is whether I know about the library.

24
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,000
Everyone, leave.

25
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:04,000
It's been so long.

26
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,680
Does it really matter

27
00:03:06,310 --> 00:03:07,470
whether I know or not?

28
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:11,360
I always like to get
to the bottom of things

29
00:03:11,576 --> 00:03:13,000
and know exactly what happened.

30
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,080
I can accept a setback,

31
00:03:15,590 --> 00:03:16,910
but I need to know

32
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,870
exactly what caused it.

33
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,840
Though I knew the truth,

34
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:26,710
I never spoke of it
or mentioned it to anyone,

35
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,680
because I didn't want to die.

36
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:31,120
I wanted to leave
the Lin Residence alive

37
00:03:31,630 --> 00:03:33,000
and reunite with my parents.

38
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:48,000
Lin Jinqi.

39
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:13,870
If you want to save Ji'er,

40
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:16,510
bring me 30,000 taels of silver.

41
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,510
You're the Young Madam
of the Lin Residence now.

42
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:21,160
Surely you can come up

43
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,310
with 30,000 taels of silver.

44
00:04:24,424 --> 00:04:26,510
When you were
in charge of the Lin Residence,

45
00:04:26,568 --> 00:04:28,408
could you have come up
with 10,000 taels?

46
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:32,360
You're
Grand Secretary Zhao's granddaughter,

47
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,270
and even you couldn't.

48
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,830
How could a mere maid like me

49
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,800
possibly come up with that much?

50
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:42,008
I didn't have an imperial decree
granting me a marriage,

51
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,160
nor am I Lin Jinqi's precious darling.

52
00:04:48,504 --> 00:04:50,840
It seems you're not trying
to make things difficult for me.

53
00:04:50,850 --> 00:04:53,256
You're trying to make things difficult
for Young Master Lin.

54
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:59,920
But Young Master Lin
doesn't even know who Ji'er is,

55
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,480
nor does he care.

56
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,750
That's what you get
for marrying Lin Jinqi.

57
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:08,600
Take your time finding a way
if you can't raise the money.

58
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,070
I'm in no hurry.

59
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:11,950
But I am.

60
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,720
That's none of my concern.

61
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,630
Ji'er was bought
by a shopkeeper of the Dai family.

62
00:05:19,784 --> 00:05:21,190
She's a servant of the Dai family.

63
00:05:21,750 --> 00:05:23,160
Even if you get the money,

64
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,160
it will go to the Dai family.

65
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:28,648
So it really has nothing to do with you.

66
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,950
I don't understand what you mean.

67
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:36,510
I'm Madam Dai.

68
00:05:36,776 --> 00:05:37,870
The Dai family's money

69
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:39,360
has everything to do with me.

70
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,800
You're Young Lady Zhao.

71
00:05:41,160 --> 00:05:43,920
Does that mean the Zhao family's
earnings belong to you?

72
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,190
What exactly are you trying to say?

73
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,070
I want to offer you an idea

74
00:05:53,112 --> 00:05:54,480
in exchange for Ji'er and Xiaopu.

75
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,120
What kind of idea

76
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,190
could be worth 30,000 taels of silver?

77
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,390
This idea will make the money you earn

78
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:07,630
truly yours,

79
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:10,630
belonging neither to
the Dai family nor the Zhao family.

80
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:15,310
I'm your father.

81
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:18,870
Never mind your silver and your dowry.

82
00:06:19,070 --> 00:06:21,830
Even you belong to the Zhao family.

83
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:24,000
Even if I beat you to death today,

84
00:06:24,190 --> 00:06:27,310
the world would only
call you disobedient and unfilial.

85
00:06:28,070 --> 00:06:28,510
Go.

86
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,600
Move her silver into the family coffers.

87
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,080
Have it deposited in the treasury.

88
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,510
They say learning teaches us reason.

89
00:06:38,510 --> 00:06:39,560
But there are some things

90
00:06:39,704 --> 00:06:41,750
I still can't make sense
of even after studying.

91
00:06:42,856 --> 00:06:45,000
Sons and daughters
are born to the same parents,

92
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:48,870
yet sons are naturally entitled
to inherit family property,

93
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:51,510
while daughters can only gain

94
00:06:51,870 --> 00:06:54,000
a small share of it through marriage,

95
00:06:54,904 --> 00:06:56,240
in the form of a so-called dowry.

96
00:06:56,312 --> 00:06:58,350
If her father and brothers
choose to give it to her,

97
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,608
only then does it belong to her.

98
00:06:59,870 --> 00:07:02,560
If they choose not to,
they can take it back at any time.

99
00:07:03,870 --> 00:07:06,360
For a woman in this world,

100
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:09,750
she obeys her father at home
and her husband after marriage.

101
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,000
No matter how capable she may be,

102
00:07:12,950 --> 00:07:14,750
she must depend on a man

103
00:07:15,510 --> 00:07:17,000
to have a place in this world.

104
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,360
Not a single coin she earns

105
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:21,310
truly belongs to her.

106
00:07:23,912 --> 00:07:24,856
Perhaps it's because

107
00:07:24,888 --> 00:07:27,830
throughout history, most of those
who wrote and shaped these ideas

108
00:07:28,160 --> 00:07:29,480
were men.

109
00:07:29,784 --> 00:07:31,920
They could never understand
a woman's hardships

110
00:07:32,190 --> 00:07:33,310
or what women truly need.

111
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,310
Then tell me.

112
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:41,560
What can I do

113
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,950
so that the money
I've worked so hard to earn

114
00:07:43,976 --> 00:07:46,200
belongs neither to
the Zhao family through my father

115
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:48,310
nor to the Dai family
through my husband,

116
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,680
but to me alone?

117
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:51,920
If what you say makes sense,

118
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:55,920
I'll give you both indentures.

119
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,870
I read a story in a book.

120
00:08:02,264 --> 00:08:03,750
During Emperor Shengzu's reign,

121
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:06,870
the Xu brothers of Chun'an divided the
family property and lived separately.

122
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:09,680
The youngest brother's widow
received only an old servant.

123
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,352
The widow sold all her hairpins,
earrings, and other jewelry

124
00:08:13,384 --> 00:08:14,390
for twelve taels of gold.

125
00:08:14,744 --> 00:08:17,544
The old servant took the gold into
the mountains to trade in lacquer.

126
00:08:17,710 --> 00:08:20,728
Twenty years later, he had amassed a
fortune worth tens of thousands in gold

127
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:22,480
and handed it all over to his madam,

128
00:08:23,070 --> 00:08:24,070
making the widow

129
00:08:24,630 --> 00:08:26,390
the wealthiest person in the county.

130
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,600
Showing off just because you can read?

131
00:08:33,784 --> 00:08:36,480
The widow was treated unfairly
when the family property was divided.

132
00:08:36,536 --> 00:08:38,184
Afraid she couldn't manage on her own,

133
00:08:38,504 --> 00:08:40,568
she didn't dare
let her husband's brothers find out.

134
00:08:40,632 --> 00:08:43,270
She secretly gave the twelve taels
of gold from selling her jewelry

135
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,600
to the old servant.

136
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,120
Twenty years later,

137
00:08:46,264 --> 00:08:49,620
the old servant returned all the tens
of thousands in gold he had earned

138
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:51,750
to the widow.

139
00:08:52,670 --> 00:08:54,670
It's an anecdote
praising the old servant

140
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,200
for his loyalty and integrity.

141
00:08:57,150 --> 00:08:58,790
But from the widow's perspective,

142
00:08:59,750 --> 00:09:02,510
our laws allow servants
to engage in trade,

143
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:04,200
but they cannot own private property.

144
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:07,720
Whatever a servant
earns belongs to the master.

145
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:12,120
By using the old servant
to conceal the truth,

146
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:14,616
the widow managed to amass
a fortune worth tens of thousands.

147
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:21,510
Qingxiang's indenture
isn't held by the Dai family

148
00:09:21,670 --> 00:09:23,000
or the Zhao family, is it?

149
00:09:24,024 --> 00:09:26,910
After being played once by that
wretched old woman of the Lin family,

150
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,536
you think I haven't learned my lesson?

151
00:09:28,870 --> 00:09:30,120
I keep it myself.

152
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:32,790
This method

153
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,000
may not let you

154
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,790
earn 30,000 taels of silver overnight,

155
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,200
but from now on,

156
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,440
every coin you earn

157
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,320
will belong to you alone.

158
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,790
Ji'er and Xiaopu's indentures.

159
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,200
I misjudged you before.

160
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,510
It's that ungrateful Lin Jinqi

161
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,670
who doesn't deserve you.

162
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,870
How about

163
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,320
you and I

164
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,600
go into business together?

165
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,080
With the Zhao,

166
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:21,360
Dai, and Lin families behind us,

167
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,320
forget 30,000 taels.

168
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:26,080
Even 50,000 or 100,000 taels,

169
00:10:26,870 --> 00:10:28,200
we could earn it.

170
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,320
Thank you for thinking so highly of me.

171
00:10:31,336 --> 00:10:33,128
But that's not where my ambitions lie.

172
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,480
What a shame.

173
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:46,550
(Indenture)
I promised to return the indentures,

174
00:10:47,510 --> 00:10:48,790
but I never promised

175
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:50,510
to let Ji'er leave today.

176
00:10:52,150 --> 00:10:54,670
Unless you can knock
the ball into the hole.

177
00:10:55,510 --> 00:10:56,360
Otherwise,

178
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,910
you'll have to come back
another day for Ji'er.

179
00:12:08,020 --> 00:12:10,100
♪Those things I can't forget♪

180
00:12:10,100 --> 00:12:14,420
♪The absurdities I can't let go
of fill every page♪

181
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:16,460
♪Building a wall♪

182
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,720
Lanxiang!

183
00:12:24,820 --> 00:12:27,100
♪Memories hide away again♪

184
00:12:27,100 --> 00:12:31,580
♪Silent, yet they never stop shining♪

185
00:12:31,580 --> 00:12:33,580
♪Still burning bright♪

186
00:12:33,580 --> 00:12:36,460
♪That's what made me who I am♪

187
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,240
You're free.

188
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:45,180
♪Etched into my heart♪

189
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:47,550
From now on,

190
00:12:48,750 --> 00:12:49,600
you're free.

191
00:12:57,870 --> 00:12:59,750
I'm free.

192
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,030
The room has just been cleaned.

193
00:13:17,270 --> 00:13:19,000
The bedding is clean, too.

194
00:13:19,390 --> 00:13:21,200
You three can stay here without worry.

195
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:23,720
I'll go get you some hot water
from the boiler room.

196
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,440
All right.

197
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,240
Thank you.

198
00:13:27,870 --> 00:13:28,720
I'll help him.

199
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,360
All right.

200
00:13:45,270 --> 00:13:46,790
This is Ji'er's indenture.

201
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,960
And this is Xiaopu's indenture.

202
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:53,780
(Indenture)

203
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,600
Good.

204
00:14:00,390 --> 00:14:02,480
This is the Deed of Emancipation
I've signed.

205
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,260
(Deed of Emancipation)

206
00:14:04,856 --> 00:14:06,870
Later, Yuchan will go
with you to the county office

207
00:14:06,870 --> 00:14:08,450
to complete the emancipation procedures.

208
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:09,870
I can act as your guarantor,

209
00:14:10,056 --> 00:14:11,670
so you can register here in the capital

210
00:14:11,790 --> 00:14:12,870
with a nearby neighborhood,

211
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,320
or return to Jinling to register.

212
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:26,550
I don't want to register in the capital,

213
00:14:26,632 --> 00:14:29,224
and I don't want to return
to Jinling to register either.

214
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:36,720
You want to find your parents?

215
00:14:37,510 --> 00:14:39,720
Do you know where your parents are?

216
00:14:41,670 --> 00:14:42,720
I'm not going to find them.

217
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,840
The only family I have is Xiaopu

218
00:14:47,390 --> 00:14:48,000
and you.

219
00:14:54,168 --> 00:14:56,150
Ji'er secretly left
all the tips from the guests

220
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:59,910
with her parents, hoping to save enough
to buy her freedom.

221
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:02,360
But one day,

222
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:05,550
when she went to see them,
she discovered

223
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:07,790
that over a month earlier,

224
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:10,790
they had taken Ji'er's money

225
00:15:10,856 --> 00:15:12,120
to buy freedom for themselves

226
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,790
and their two sons,

227
00:15:15,240 --> 00:15:16,390
and then secretly fled.

228
00:15:31,790 --> 00:15:33,150
There's nothing to be sad about.

229
00:15:33,790 --> 00:15:34,600
That money

230
00:15:34,790 --> 00:15:36,910
can count as repayment
for your parents raising you.

231
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:39,032
From now on, you owe each other nothing.

232
00:15:39,160 --> 00:15:40,720
You can each live your own lives.

233
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,390
That's exactly how I see it.

234
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,600
Xiaopu and I already agreed

235
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,440
that if we ever gained our freedom,

236
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:54,600
we'd go to Quanzhou.

237
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:56,720
Quanzhou?

238
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:01,000
The merchants who trade by sea

239
00:16:01,000 --> 00:16:02,150
often talk about Quanzhou.

240
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:04,360
They say it's unlike anywhere else.

241
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,720
There are enormous seagoing ships,

242
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,960
all kinds of exotic goods from overseas,

243
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:12,670
men of different skin colors,

244
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,270
and even blonde women

245
00:16:14,550 --> 00:16:16,320
with their legs and chests exposed.

246
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:18,960
Quanzhou

247
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:21,440
is different from the capital, Yangzhou,

248
00:16:21,510 --> 00:16:23,390
and Jinling.

249
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:26,390
Women there can establish their
own households and support themselves.

250
00:16:27,112 --> 00:16:28,424
What do they call it again?

251
00:16:29,192 --> 00:16:30,120
Female households.

252
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:32,150
Right, female households.

253
00:16:32,824 --> 00:16:35,200
In Quanzhou, once a woman
establishes a female household,

254
00:16:35,256 --> 00:16:36,670
she doesn't have to depend on a man.

255
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:38,390
She can go out on her own,

256
00:16:38,790 --> 00:16:40,600
run a shop, and do business.

257
00:16:43,688 --> 00:16:46,104
Although they'll
be looked down upon by scholars

258
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:47,910
and ladies of respectable families,

259
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,510
merchants don't mind dealing with them

260
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:52,600
as long as there's money to be made.

261
00:16:55,670 --> 00:16:56,790
You want to go somewhere

262
00:16:56,790 --> 00:16:58,240
completely different

263
00:16:58,670 --> 00:16:59,840
and start over?

264
00:17:09,580 --> 00:17:11,620
(Indenture)

265
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:14,152
Not as a maid of the Lin Residence,

266
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,750
not as Young Lady Shuang,

267
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,880
not as Concubine Lv.

268
00:17:27,110 --> 00:17:29,110
I want to truly live

269
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:31,200
as Lv Ji'er for once.

270
00:17:44,590 --> 00:17:46,790
Can I go to Quanzhou with you?

271
00:17:50,360 --> 00:17:52,750
Xiaopu and I would certainly
welcome another helping hand.

272
00:17:54,550 --> 00:17:56,400
But even in Quanzhou,

273
00:17:56,472 --> 00:17:58,990
women who establish their own
households and support themselves

274
00:17:59,070 --> 00:18:01,750
are called shameless
and treated with contempt.

275
00:18:06,936 --> 00:18:09,208
I've long since stopped caring
what people think of me.

276
00:18:15,750 --> 00:18:16,240
All right.

277
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,400
The three of us

278
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:19,784
will go to Quanzhou together.

279
00:18:29,030 --> 00:18:29,920
But

280
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,160
we'll still need Lanxiang's help

281
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:35,240
to get the three of us

282
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,720
registered in Quanzhou.

283
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:41,480
Have you all made up your minds?

284
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:56,640
Yes.

285
00:18:57,790 --> 00:19:00,070
I'll find a way
to help you register there.

286
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:06,510
That's wonderful, Lanxiang.

287
00:19:07,110 --> 00:19:09,110
What am I going to do?
You're too good to me.

288
00:19:10,590 --> 00:19:12,200
I almost don't want to leave.

289
00:19:13,310 --> 00:19:14,920
Then stay here with me.

290
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:20,240
But I won't put myself
through that again.

291
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:26,510
From this day forward,

292
00:19:28,270 --> 00:19:30,240
the person who will
treat me best in this world

293
00:19:31,750 --> 00:19:32,680
is myself.

294
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:36,160
Good.

295
00:19:59,464 --> 00:20:00,680
You're saying the Young Madam

296
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:02,350
didn't give Madam Dai a single coin

297
00:20:02,830 --> 00:20:04,030
and still brought them back?

298
00:20:06,070 --> 00:20:08,640
Young Master really underestimated
the Young Madam this time.

299
00:20:09,750 --> 00:20:11,070
I saw it with my own eyes.

300
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:13,160
The Young Madam spoke
with Madam Dai for a while,

301
00:20:13,270 --> 00:20:15,240
and Madam Dai handed her the indentures.

302
00:20:16,072 --> 00:20:17,510
I asked the Young Madam afterward,

303
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:20,590
and she said that as a fellow woman,

304
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:22,720
she understood Madam Dai's pain.

305
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:25,240
She reasoned with her
and showed her the benefits,

306
00:20:25,416 --> 00:20:28,216
joking that she'd gotten what she wanted
without spending a thing.

307
00:20:30,750 --> 00:20:32,480
Reason with her

308
00:20:33,510 --> 00:20:34,790
and show her the benefits.

309
00:20:41,830 --> 00:20:43,440
Young Master, you can rest now.

310
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:49,880
Didn't you say the Young Madam
wanted to get those three

311
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:51,160
registered in Quanzhou?

312
00:20:51,440 --> 00:20:52,070
Yes.

313
00:20:52,232 --> 00:20:54,000
The Young Madam
even went to the bookshop

314
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:56,510
and borrowed several books
on laws and household registration.

315
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:01,240
Did you tell her

316
00:21:01,590 --> 00:21:02,750
what I asked you to?

317
00:21:03,070 --> 00:21:03,720
Yes.

318
00:21:04,070 --> 00:21:05,240
I told the Young Madam

319
00:21:05,270 --> 00:21:06,640
that a superior you were

320
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:08,070
close to back in Jinzhou

321
00:21:08,110 --> 00:21:10,280
is now Assistant Commander
of the Quanzhou Garrison.

322
00:21:15,270 --> 00:21:16,350
Then tell me.

323
00:21:17,510 --> 00:21:19,400
Do you think she didn't
understand what I meant?

324
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:22,070
Even I understood.

325
00:21:22,168 --> 00:21:22,936
Given your

326
00:21:22,940 --> 00:21:25,580
relationship with the Assistant
Commander of the Quanzhou Garrison,

327
00:21:25,590 --> 00:21:27,680
getting Ji'er and the others
registered in Quanzhou

328
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,000
would only take a word from you.

329
00:21:29,032 --> 00:21:30,790
How could
the Young Madam not understand?

330
00:21:38,790 --> 00:21:40,510
Since it's on your mind,

331
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,960
why not offer to help her?

332
00:21:43,352 --> 00:21:45,560
You'd solve
the Young Madam's urgent problem,

333
00:21:45,790 --> 00:21:47,400
and you'd be able to sleep soundly, too.

334
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:52,310
Nonsense.

335
00:21:52,472 --> 00:21:54,880
Even when the Wo pirates attacked,
I slept perfectly soundly.

336
00:21:54,960 --> 00:21:56,070
Now that I'm in my own home,

337
00:21:56,216 --> 00:21:57,590
why wouldn't I sleep soundly?

338
00:21:58,424 --> 00:21:59,680
I'm going to sleep right now.

339
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:01,110
I won't wake up until morning.

340
00:22:28,648 --> 00:22:31,240
It's not easy for an adult man
to establish his own household.

341
00:22:31,920 --> 00:22:33,790
He needs the consent
of his senior clansmen

342
00:22:33,800 --> 00:22:35,816
and a neighborhood headman
to act as guarantor.

343
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:39,110
It's even harder for an adult woman
to establish her own household.

344
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,960
She's lucky if she's allowed to at all.

345
00:22:42,760 --> 00:22:44,320
It even says here that female households

346
00:22:44,510 --> 00:22:47,336
should be abolished if they
hinder the collection of corvée duties.

347
00:22:48,110 --> 00:22:57,240
A female household must be verified
to have no adult male members.

348
00:22:58,630 --> 00:23:01,272
To establish a female household,
besides having no husband or sons

349
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:03,624
and truly having no adult male
in the household,

350
00:23:04,088 --> 00:23:06,110
she must own taxable farmland
in the countryside

351
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,440
or property in an urban neighborhood

352
00:23:09,110 --> 00:23:10,510
before she can register locally.

353
00:23:13,064 --> 00:23:14,350
That shouldn't be a problem.

354
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:15,960
Ji'er and the others

355
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:18,264
are going there to make a living
through business anyway.

356
00:23:18,296 --> 00:23:20,940
Sooner or later, they'll acquire
property in an urban neighborhood.

357
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:23,590
They just need to set aside
the money in advance.

358
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:25,790
Then what's the difficulty?

359
00:23:28,070 --> 00:23:29,550
Anyone registering as a local resident

360
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:31,464
needs a respected local resident

361
00:23:31,496 --> 00:23:33,350
to recommend them and act as a guarantor

362
00:23:33,510 --> 00:23:35,590
before they can settle there.

363
00:23:36,240 --> 00:23:38,350
Then just ask them to be guarantors.

364
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:40,880
Give them some gifts
and ask for their help.

365
00:23:41,790 --> 00:23:43,200
It's not a matter of giving gifts.

366
00:23:43,512 --> 00:23:45,550
Since they're respected members
of the community,

367
00:23:45,560 --> 00:23:47,820
they may disapprove
of Ji'er and the others' backgrounds

368
00:23:47,830 --> 00:23:49,480
and refuse their gifts outright.

369
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,310
If the neighbors found out otherwise,

370
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:54,720
their lifelong reputations
would be ruined.

371
00:24:13,110 --> 00:24:14,000
Young Master.

372
00:24:23,112 --> 00:24:24,680
Young Master, please sit.

373
00:24:31,590 --> 00:24:33,070
If you keep studying like this,

374
00:24:34,456 --> 00:24:36,590
you could take a post
at the Ministry of Revenue.

375
00:24:40,200 --> 00:24:42,200
No amount of reading will help Ji'er.

376
00:24:43,510 --> 00:24:44,920
I'll just have to swallow my pride

377
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:46,720
and ask you for help.

378
00:24:51,590 --> 00:24:52,790
We're husband and wife.

379
00:24:53,448 --> 00:24:54,960
There's no need to speak like that.

380
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,310
We should help each other.

381
00:25:07,240 --> 00:25:08,590
After Yuchan told me,

382
00:25:08,790 --> 00:25:10,310
I'd already written a letter

383
00:25:10,344 --> 00:25:12,472
and sent someone
to deliver it to Quanzhou.

384
00:25:14,310 --> 00:25:17,790
The wife of the Assistant Commander
of the Quanzhou Garrison is surnamed Xu.

385
00:25:18,280 --> 00:25:19,920
Her surname sounds the same as yours,

386
00:25:20,232 --> 00:25:22,390
but it's the Xu written
with the double-person radical.

387
00:25:23,590 --> 00:25:26,720
Write a letter
of introduction to Madam Xu

388
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:30,310
and have Young Lady Lv and the other two
take it to Quanzhou.

389
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:34,160
Madam Xu will help make the necessary
arrangements with the local neighborhood

390
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:36,350
and get their household
registration settled.

391
00:25:41,590 --> 00:25:42,350
Thank you.

392
00:25:49,270 --> 00:25:50,790
I'm not capable enough yet

393
00:25:52,590 --> 00:25:54,720
to even help my own sisters,

394
00:25:57,160 --> 00:25:59,000
and I have no way to repay you.

395
00:26:03,510 --> 00:26:05,590
If you ever need my help in the future,

396
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:08,200
I'll do everything I can.

397
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:13,880
I only want

398
00:26:15,510 --> 00:26:16,960
you to be my wife.

399
00:26:24,310 --> 00:26:25,880
Aren't I already?

400
00:26:31,590 --> 00:26:32,720
What I want

401
00:26:34,880 --> 00:26:37,110
isn't just to have you here with me,

402
00:26:39,680 --> 00:26:40,790
but your heart as well.

403
00:26:45,960 --> 00:26:47,240
I'm already here.

404
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:50,590
Where could my heart possibly go?

405
00:26:51,140 --> 00:26:56,020
♪Through life's winding road,
we've weathered countless trials♪

406
00:26:58,140 --> 00:27:02,020
♪I'm blessed to spend
each peaceful day and night with you♪

407
00:27:02,030 --> 00:27:03,310
You're so clever.

408
00:27:04,792 --> 00:27:06,888
There's no way
you don't understand what I mean.

409
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:12,070
You're simply
pretending not to understand.

410
00:27:12,660 --> 00:27:15,380
♪Our bond runs deep♪

411
00:27:16,060 --> 00:27:19,060
♪Binding us closely together♪

412
00:27:19,860 --> 00:27:22,620
♪Washing away
the dust of this mortal world♪

413
00:27:22,620 --> 00:27:26,820
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

414
00:27:27,500 --> 00:27:31,420
♪I'll have no regrets
that we met in this life♪

415
00:27:31,420 --> 00:27:35,420
♪May we stay together until life's end♪

416
00:27:35,420 --> 00:27:39,060
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

417
00:27:39,060 --> 00:27:42,860
♪Has long taken root in my heart♪

418
00:27:42,860 --> 00:27:45,740
♪Our bond runs deep♪

419
00:27:46,500 --> 00:27:49,580
♪Binding us closely together♪

420
00:27:50,220 --> 00:27:53,140
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

421
00:27:53,140 --> 00:27:57,380
♪This love has never
faded in the slightest♪

422
00:27:58,060 --> 00:28:01,900
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

423
00:28:02,260 --> 00:28:05,660
♪How fortunate
to find one person in a lifetime♪

424
00:28:06,300 --> 00:28:08,020
♪Through these warm and gentle years♪

425
00:28:08,340 --> 00:28:13,380
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

426
00:28:13,380 --> 00:28:19,240
(Chengding Gate)

427
00:28:19,304 --> 00:28:21,690
It's already the twenty-fifth day
of the twelfth lunar month.

428
00:28:21,790 --> 00:28:23,710
Can't you wait until
after the Chinese New Year

429
00:28:23,720 --> 00:28:25,240
and leave when the weather gets warmer?

430
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:27,440
The Chinese New Year
is for families to reunite.

431
00:28:28,590 --> 00:28:30,510
My family is right here with me.

432
00:28:32,120 --> 00:28:35,080
Wherever we go, that's where we'll
celebrate the Chinese New Year.

433
00:28:36,480 --> 00:28:37,590
Even if we stayed here,

434
00:28:37,640 --> 00:28:39,640
we couldn't spend
Chinese New Year's Eve with you.

435
00:28:39,830 --> 00:28:41,880
So we thought
we'd head to Quanzhou early.

436
00:28:42,720 --> 00:28:43,790
We want to set off early.

437
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:46,680
I know you can't wait.

438
00:28:50,070 --> 00:28:52,790
Once you reach Quanzhou,
be sure to write to me.

439
00:28:54,040 --> 00:28:56,550
Xiaopu knows a little writing,
so she'll write to you first.

440
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:58,920
Once I learn how to write,

441
00:28:59,030 --> 00:29:00,136
I'll write to you myself.

442
00:29:00,232 --> 00:29:01,960
Don't laugh if my handwriting is ugly.

443
00:29:03,350 --> 00:29:06,000
I'll learn to write too
and send you letters.

444
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:07,270
All right.

445
00:29:10,760 --> 00:29:11,496
Baogai.

446
00:29:17,510 --> 00:29:18,960
Here are some old clothes.

447
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:20,200
Keep them to wear.

448
00:29:21,750 --> 00:29:23,510
And as a memento.

449
00:29:46,550 --> 00:29:47,750
Three padded coats.

450
00:29:48,536 --> 00:29:50,030
We've sewn gold leaves into them.

451
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:53,350
They're worth 500 taels of silver.

452
00:30:01,352 --> 00:30:04,160
Once you're in the mule cart,
put them on and keep them close.

453
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:22,960
Xiaolian, Baogai, and I

454
00:30:23,110 --> 00:30:25,080
scraped together
30 taels of silver for you.

455
00:30:26,680 --> 00:30:27,550
No.

456
00:30:28,590 --> 00:30:30,030
Yuchan added another 20 taels.

457
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:31,400
That's 50 taels in total.

458
00:30:31,590 --> 00:30:33,920
No. I can't take it.

459
00:30:34,030 --> 00:30:37,110
You've already
given me money for the journey.

460
00:30:37,790 --> 00:30:39,070
Quanzhou is so far away.

461
00:30:39,224 --> 00:30:41,480
I hear we won't even understand
how the locals speak.

462
00:30:41,576 --> 00:30:43,200
There's not much we can do to help you.

463
00:30:43,270 --> 00:30:45,208
All we can do
is put together some money for you.

464
00:30:46,400 --> 00:30:47,510
You must keep it safe.

465
00:30:53,848 --> 00:30:55,750
They say you should travel
with plenty of money.

466
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,440
Just consider it a loan from us.

467
00:30:58,590 --> 00:31:01,240
You can pay us back
once you've made some money.

468
00:31:08,552 --> 00:31:09,960
I'd already made up my mind.

469
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:11,550
I absolutely wasn't going to cry today.

470
00:31:13,192 --> 00:31:14,310
We're going to Quanzhou.

471
00:31:14,310 --> 00:31:15,880
This is wonderful news.

472
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:17,960
I want to leave happily.

473
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:19,160
I want to leave with a smile.

474
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:22,270
It's all your fault.

475
00:31:22,480 --> 00:31:24,160
You just had to make me cry again.

476
00:31:25,160 --> 00:31:28,270
Tears don't cost anything.
Just cry if you want.

477
00:31:28,312 --> 00:31:30,030
It's because I know tears are worthless

478
00:31:30,030 --> 00:31:31,160
that I don't want to cry.

479
00:31:38,110 --> 00:31:39,510
It's all your fault.

480
00:31:53,112 --> 00:31:55,080
Young Madam.
The caravan is already far ahead.

481
00:31:55,090 --> 00:31:56,760
They need to catch up
as soon as possible.

482
00:31:56,880 --> 00:31:58,200
If they miss this caravan,

483
00:31:58,270 --> 00:31:59,550
the next one going to Quanzhou

484
00:31:59,550 --> 00:32:00,880
won't leave until next spring.

485
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:05,550
We're going now.

486
00:32:06,110 --> 00:32:08,310
We're going. Let's go.

487
00:32:22,216 --> 00:32:23,750
Take good care of yourselves.

488
00:32:31,310 --> 00:32:33,400
We're leaving. Goodbye.

489
00:32:34,740 --> 00:32:37,300
♪All things fall silent, fearing♪

490
00:32:37,300 --> 00:32:40,660
♪To disturb this moment♪

491
00:32:41,420 --> 00:32:44,220
♪My restless heart♪

492
00:32:44,580 --> 00:32:48,420
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

493
00:32:49,060 --> 00:32:54,740
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

494
00:32:57,500 --> 00:33:00,740
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

495
00:33:00,740 --> 00:33:04,260
♪Lightly sketch out cause and effect♪

496
00:33:04,980 --> 00:33:07,540
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

497
00:33:07,540 --> 00:33:11,220
♪Returns to this moment♪

498
00:33:11,220 --> 00:33:15,060
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

499
00:33:15,060 --> 00:33:18,540
♪If the shadow isn't real, what then?♪

500
00:33:20,590 --> 00:33:23,640
Be careful on the way.
Take good care of yourself!

501
00:33:24,920 --> 00:33:26,590
I'll live well!

502
00:33:27,310 --> 00:33:30,640
You'd better live well, too!

503
00:33:34,220 --> 00:33:37,780
♪I only hope those I once knew remain♪

504
00:33:37,780 --> 00:33:41,380
♪Safe and well as they grow♪

505
00:33:41,380 --> 00:33:46,140
♪Never again letting
the world's wind and snow fall♪

506
00:33:46,140 --> 00:33:48,900
♪And cover the grass and trees in frost♪

507
00:33:48,900 --> 00:33:53,140
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

508
00:33:53,340 --> 00:33:58,060
♪You and I will go together♪

509
00:34:00,350 --> 00:34:01,480
(From this day forward,)

510
00:34:01,960 --> 00:34:03,480
(not as a maid of the Lin Residence,)

511
00:34:03,880 --> 00:34:05,160
(not as Young Lady Shuang,)

512
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:07,830
(not as Concubine Lv.)

513
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:10,630
(I want to truly live as Lv Ji'er)

514
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:12,800
(for once.)

515
00:34:17,190 --> 00:34:19,190
(My surname is Lv. My name is Ji'er.)

516
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:21,190
I can cook and do laundry.

517
00:34:21,590 --> 00:34:23,710
I raised all my younger brothers myself.

518
00:34:23,710 --> 00:34:26,320
From now on, everyone
in this room will listen to Ji'er.

519
00:34:27,070 --> 00:34:28,510
So what if I'm a third-rank maid?

520
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:31,070
I didn't steal it!

521
00:34:31,280 --> 00:34:32,510
Now that there's someone new,

522
00:34:33,070 --> 00:34:34,510
no one listens to me anymore.

523
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:36,360
If you're so capable, go hit a man!

524
00:34:37,110 --> 00:34:38,110
From this day forward,

525
00:34:38,590 --> 00:34:40,630
the person who will
treat me best in this world

526
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:41,760
is myself.

527
00:34:48,632 --> 00:34:51,192
Ji'er and the others are traveling
with a large merchant caravan.

528
00:34:52,110 --> 00:34:53,480
The journey may be difficult,

529
00:34:53,560 --> 00:34:55,480
but there's no need
to worry about their safety.

530
00:34:56,630 --> 00:34:58,360
They'll definitely
reach Quanzhou safely.

531
00:35:09,700 --> 00:35:13,980
(500 taels were raised by pawning.)

532
00:35:30,670 --> 00:35:33,550
Ji'er and the other two
didn't have a penny.

533
00:35:34,110 --> 00:35:35,480
The Young Madam gave them

534
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,670
300 taels from her dowry
for the journey.

535
00:35:38,510 --> 00:35:39,360
In private,

536
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:42,360
the Young Madam also had
Baogai quietly go to a pawnshop

537
00:35:44,030 --> 00:35:46,190
and pawn her jewelry
for 500 taels of silver.

538
00:35:46,328 --> 00:35:49,304
She exchanged it for gold leaves
and sewed them into old padded coats.

539
00:35:49,352 --> 00:35:51,220
She was even afraid
Ji'er wouldn't accept them,

540
00:35:51,230 --> 00:35:53,550
so she waited until
they were parting to give them to her.

541
00:35:53,720 --> 00:35:56,190
People say I'm one of His Majesty's
most trusted officials,

542
00:35:57,110 --> 00:35:58,670
at the height of my glory.

543
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:01,920
Yet my own wife

544
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,550
had to pawn her jewelry

545
00:36:05,510 --> 00:36:06,920
for 500 taels.

546
00:36:09,912 --> 00:36:11,848
The Young Madam
only pawned them temporarily.

547
00:36:11,928 --> 00:36:14,840
She arranged with the pawnshop
to redeem them within three months.

548
00:36:16,070 --> 00:36:18,070
She only needed
some money to tide her over.

549
00:36:18,296 --> 00:36:20,710
That's common among
wealthy families in the capital, too.

550
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:25,110
I'm not angry with her.

551
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:27,150
Why are you all so anxious?

552
00:36:27,670 --> 00:36:29,110
The Young Madam is a good person.

553
00:36:31,190 --> 00:36:31,760
Yes.

554
00:36:32,550 --> 00:36:34,920
The Young Madam is kindhearted.

555
00:36:39,480 --> 00:36:42,190
Young Master, you're a good person, too.

556
00:36:49,510 --> 00:36:50,320
Enough.

557
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:53,800
How would I dare be angry with her?

558
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:56,440
I just want to see

559
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:57,920
how she's going to

560
00:36:59,030 --> 00:37:00,590
redeem the jewelry when the time comes.

561
00:37:01,150 --> 00:37:02,000
Now,

562
00:37:02,590 --> 00:37:05,070
the Young Madam
has no private savings left.

563
00:37:06,590 --> 00:37:07,880
Young Master, you'll have to

564
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:09,320
think of something.

565
00:37:09,550 --> 00:37:10,480
Otherwise,

566
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:12,440
forget redeeming the jewelry.

567
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:14,840
Even everyday expenses
and social obligations

568
00:37:15,150 --> 00:37:16,400
require money.

569
00:37:17,630 --> 00:37:18,960
The Young Madam will find a way.

570
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:28,630
Even I'm not that confident.

571
00:37:29,840 --> 00:37:31,480
What makes you so confident?

572
00:37:32,984 --> 00:37:35,000
Back then, didn't you also
think that as a woman,

573
00:37:35,032 --> 00:37:37,320
the Young Madam
was alone and powerless

574
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:39,210
and couldn't get Ji'er back
without your help?

575
00:37:39,510 --> 00:37:42,280
But she proved that
she not only did it without your help,

576
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:44,800
but she also got Ji'er back
without spending a single coin.

577
00:37:48,150 --> 00:37:50,320
Yuchan is simple by nature.

578
00:37:53,976 --> 00:37:56,136
Ever since she started
serving the Young Madam,

579
00:37:56,190 --> 00:37:57,400
she's been completely

580
00:37:58,150 --> 00:37:59,150
devoted to her.

581
00:38:03,230 --> 00:38:04,320
All right.

582
00:38:05,704 --> 00:38:06,920
Whether that's true or not,

583
00:38:07,590 --> 00:38:08,440
we'll know

584
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:10,070
in three months.

585
00:38:11,220 --> 00:38:12,900
(500 taels were raised by pawning.)

586
00:38:14,380 --> 00:38:17,420
(Three Months Later)

587
00:38:43,980 --> 00:38:47,380
(Ting Lizi, Troupe Leader
of Xiaofurong Troupe)

588
00:38:50,320 --> 00:38:52,110
Troupe Leader, Madam Lin is here.

589
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:57,550
Didn't you say coming here
could cure your homesickness?

590
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:59,110
You haven't come in so long.

591
00:38:59,590 --> 00:39:01,480
It seems you don't miss my master

592
00:39:01,480 --> 00:39:02,440
or Mister Lu at all.

593
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:05,960
I didn't dare come too often.

594
00:39:06,400 --> 00:39:08,840
I was afraid you'd think
I was here to ask for money.

595
00:39:09,400 --> 00:39:10,590
So this time,

596
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:12,190
you're not here for money?

597
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:17,630
This time, I'm mainly here
to cure my homesickness

598
00:39:17,784 --> 00:39:19,190
and ask for money while I'm at it.

599
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,190
Here's 50 taels.

600
00:39:22,590 --> 00:39:24,190
Together with the previous 100 taels,

601
00:39:25,110 --> 00:39:25,960
over three months,

602
00:39:26,360 --> 00:39:27,710
that's a total of 150 taels.

603
00:39:29,336 --> 00:39:30,696
Before the Chinese New Year,

604
00:39:30,712 --> 00:39:33,336
my master brought together
opera troupes from Jinling,

605
00:39:33,590 --> 00:39:34,670
the capital, and Suzhou

606
00:39:34,670 --> 00:39:36,150
to stage the new play together.

607
00:39:36,550 --> 00:39:39,190
The Tale of the Feathered Immortal
became an instant hit.

608
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:40,710
These days,

609
00:39:40,760 --> 00:39:42,960
if any lady hasn't seen it yet,

610
00:39:42,960 --> 00:39:45,550
she has to hurry and invite a troupe
to perform at her residence.

611
00:39:46,030 --> 00:39:48,480
Otherwise, when she's with other ladies,

612
00:39:48,510 --> 00:39:50,536
she won't even
have anything to talk about.

613
00:39:51,920 --> 00:39:53,000
In just these three months,

614
00:39:53,550 --> 00:39:55,670
we've earned as much
as we used to in an entire year.

615
00:39:56,872 --> 00:39:58,670
It's because you performed it so well

616
00:39:58,710 --> 00:40:00,230
that the play became such a hit.

617
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:03,630
No matter how well we perform,
we still need a good script.

618
00:40:03,832 --> 00:40:05,400
(Xu Lanxiang)
These days, who can hear

619
00:40:05,410 --> 00:40:07,160
The Tale of the Feathered Immortal

620
00:40:07,224 --> 00:40:09,230
without praising
its clear and graceful style,

621
00:40:09,288 --> 00:40:11,272
appealing to both
refined and popular tastes?

622
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:14,320
Even Scholar Shouyi
of Qixia Academy said

623
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:17,400
it combines the beauty
of southern tunes and northern lyrics

624
00:40:17,464 --> 00:40:19,352
while bringing forth something new.

625
00:40:21,510 --> 00:40:23,280
Many outsiders are guessing

626
00:40:23,630 --> 00:40:25,800
that Shen Rugu, who wrote the play,

627
00:40:26,110 --> 00:40:27,320
is actually Mister Lu,

628
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:30,630
and that Mister Lu
simply changed his writing style

629
00:40:31,190 --> 00:40:32,840
but feared people would gossip,

630
00:40:33,352 --> 00:40:35,496
so he deliberately
used a different pen name.

631
00:40:36,710 --> 00:40:37,510
Tell me.

632
00:40:38,320 --> 00:40:39,710
Is it really Mister Lu?

633
00:40:41,710 --> 00:40:43,550
I only help my master keep the accounts.

634
00:40:43,840 --> 00:40:45,510
As for what my master is thinking,

635
00:40:45,630 --> 00:40:47,960
I can't say, I dare not say,

636
00:40:48,072 --> 00:40:50,232
and it wouldn't be appropriate to say.

637
00:40:52,630 --> 00:40:53,960
I heard Shunqing say

638
00:40:54,150 --> 00:40:55,688
you still need to go to the pawnshop.

639
00:40:55,960 --> 00:40:57,190
Then I won't keep you.

640
00:40:58,630 --> 00:41:00,440
Come back for a play when you have time.

641
00:41:15,860 --> 00:41:18,380
(500 taels were raised by pawning.)

642
00:41:21,432 --> 00:41:24,150
I was just about to go to the pawnshop
to redeem my jewelry

643
00:41:24,190 --> 00:41:25,510
when Yuchan told me

644
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:27,590
that you had already redeemed it.

645
00:41:28,510 --> 00:41:29,960
I'm sorry to have troubled you.

646
00:41:30,360 --> 00:41:31,800
Here are 500 taels of silver.

647
00:41:32,030 --> 00:41:33,230
Please accept them.

648
00:41:37,190 --> 00:41:38,440
We're husband and wife.

649
00:41:39,320 --> 00:41:40,630
There's no need to be so formal.

650
00:41:44,030 --> 00:41:45,070
The books say

651
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:47,630
a true gentleman
keeps money matters clear.

652
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:52,480
I didn't blame you

653
00:41:53,030 --> 00:41:54,360
for giving the money to Lv Ji'er.

654
00:41:55,280 --> 00:41:56,360
I'm just curious

655
00:41:56,710 --> 00:41:58,550
how you managed to earn so much money

656
00:41:59,320 --> 00:42:00,360
in only three months.

657
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:13,800
I thought they'd
already told you everything.

658
00:42:15,070 --> 00:42:16,760
I only know that this silver

659
00:42:16,856 --> 00:42:18,360
came from opera troupes in Jinling,

660
00:42:18,440 --> 00:42:20,960
Suzhou, and the capital

661
00:42:21,150 --> 00:42:22,800
under Mister Lu's name.

662
00:42:23,550 --> 00:42:26,070
But I don't know what you did.

663
00:42:30,150 --> 00:42:31,760
I'm Mister Lu's student.

664
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:32,880
What else could I do?

665
00:42:33,550 --> 00:42:35,280
Naturally, I wrote plays for performers.

666
00:42:43,590 --> 00:42:44,400
I know

667
00:42:44,590 --> 00:42:45,880
you surely can't accept

668
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:48,280
the wife of the Lin family
writing plays for performers.

669
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:50,840
If word gets out,

670
00:42:50,840 --> 00:42:52,360
it won't reflect well on the family.

671
00:42:52,590 --> 00:42:55,590
I might even be condemned
for corrupting public morals.

672
00:42:56,710 --> 00:42:58,360
But this is what I want to do.

673
00:42:58,920 --> 00:43:00,550
I decided on it before I married you.

674
00:43:04,860 --> 00:43:07,380
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

675
00:43:10,670 --> 00:43:12,190
(It's my fault for being so helpless.)

676
00:43:14,590 --> 00:43:17,280
(From now on, you won't have
to live in fear with me anymore.)

677
00:43:18,260 --> 00:43:20,100
(Arsenic)

678
00:43:29,710 --> 00:43:30,550
What are you doing?

679
00:43:40,550 --> 00:43:41,400
What?

680
00:43:41,700 --> 00:43:43,420
(Arsenic)

681
00:44:00,981 --> 00:44:05,101
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

682
00:44:07,941 --> 00:44:12,461
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

683
00:44:13,741 --> 00:44:17,661
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

684
00:44:18,341 --> 00:44:21,101
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

685
00:44:21,821 --> 00:44:24,141
♪Though all the world may fade♪

686
00:44:24,141 --> 00:44:27,221
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

687
00:44:28,741 --> 00:44:32,981
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

688
00:44:35,901 --> 00:44:40,061
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

689
00:44:41,861 --> 00:44:45,421
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

690
00:44:45,421 --> 00:44:48,981
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

691
00:44:49,781 --> 00:44:55,461
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

692
00:44:55,821 --> 00:45:00,141
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

693
00:45:00,501 --> 00:45:03,461
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

694
00:45:03,461 --> 00:45:07,221
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

695
00:45:07,221 --> 00:45:10,101
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

696
00:45:10,101 --> 00:45:14,181
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

697
00:45:14,181 --> 00:45:17,541
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

698
00:45:17,541 --> 00:45:21,301
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

699
00:45:21,301 --> 00:45:25,301
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

700
00:45:26,061 --> 00:45:30,221
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

701
00:45:30,221 --> 00:45:33,661
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

702
00:45:33,661 --> 00:45:37,301
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

703
00:45:37,301 --> 00:45:40,181
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

704
00:45:40,181 --> 00:45:44,261
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

705
00:45:44,261 --> 00:45:47,621
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

706
00:45:47,621 --> 00:45:51,261
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

707
00:45:51,261 --> 00:45:59,061
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
